{"output":"I’ll locate the search logic, check how requests update state, and make a focused fix before running the existing tests.\n\nEvery request currently updates state when it finishes, even if a newer search has started. I’ll add a request counter and guard results, errors, and loading updates. Clearing the query will also invalidate pending requests. The existing tests lack race coverage, so I’ll run a temporary probe without changing test files.\n\nFixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test (4 passed), node --input-type=module race probe, and git diff --check all exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","final_output":"Fixed src/search/controller.ts with a request counter so only the latest search updates results, loading, or errors. Clearing immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests. Public API and normal behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification: npm test (4 passed), node --input-type=module race probe, and git diff --check all exited 0. No tests modified or dependencies installed.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":10,"tool_calls":[{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/4-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":187,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-14e9aea81fdeee078ed879cc4a0741f1.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"edit_file","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"npm test\nsuite_status=$?\nnode --input-type=module <<'NODE'\nimport assert from 'node:assert/strict';\nimport { createSearchController } from './src/search/controller.ts';\nconst items = [{ id: 'new', title: 'Latest', url: '/latest' }];\nfor (const outcome of ['resolve', 'reject']) {\n  for (const phase of ['pending', 'finished', 'cleared']) {\n    const requests = [];\n    const c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((resolve, reject) => requests.push({ resolve, reject })) });\n    const old = c.search('same');\n    const latest = c.search('same');\n    if (phase !== 'pending') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items);\n      await latest;\n    }\n    if (phase === 'cleared') {\n      await c.search('  ');\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n    const before = c.getState();\n    requests[0][outcome](outcome === 'resolve' ? [] : new Error('Stale failure'));\n    await old;\n    assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), before);\n    if (phase === 'pending') {\n      requests[1].resolve(items);\n      await latest;\n      assert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: 'same', results: items, loading: false, error: null });\n    }\n  }\n}\nlet reject;\nconst c = createSearchController({ search: () => new Promise((_, r) => { reject = r; }) });\nconst pending = c.search('query');\nvoid c.search('');\nassert.deepEqual(c.getState(), { query: '', results: [], loading: false, error: null });\nreject(new Error('Late failure'));\nawait pending;\nassert.equal(c.getState().error, null);\nconsole.log('Race probe passed');\nNODE\nprobe_status=$?\ngit diff --check\ncheck_status=$?\ngit diff --stat\ngit diff -- src/search/controller.ts\nprintf '\\nExit codes: tests=%s probe=%s diff-check=%s\\n' \"$suite_status\" \"$probe_status\" \"$check_status\"","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-efficiency-m_m99ddq/4-1-optimized/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":370,"stdout_bytes":2263,"stderr_bytes":0,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-68513adc6bcc33402059011f407b73c5.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":33265,"output_tokens":1134},"usage_details":{"cached_input_tokens":6400,"cache_write_tokens":0,"reasoning_tokens":8}}
